# Function boundaries of pointer_ttt2.s, one "start end" label pair per line, as a control-flow walk
# gives them, plus two deliberately wrong starts (after_call, handler_label) that the resolver's
# ahead-of-time checks must refuse. scripts/codegen-smoke-test.sh turns this into the [functions]
# reference recomp/tools/resolve_functions.py checks against (the stand-in for TTT2 Web's table).
# _start has a .pdata entry and needs no line.
cond_split cond_target
cond_target jump_over
jump_over mid_leaf
mid_leaf over_target
over_target jump_twice
jump_twice twice_caller
twice_caller after_call
after_call twice_end
fold_only fold_end
handler_label handler_end
